+- `go vet ./tools/...`, empty `gofmt -l tools`, and `git diff --check` -> exit 0.
+- `probe-r4.py` -> exit 0.
+- `validator-mutation-probe-r4.py` -> exit 0, 13/13 semantic adversarial
